<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Residualized Similarity for Faithfully Explainable Authorship Verification</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Peter Zeng<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup"><math id="m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\blacklozenge\spadesuit" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">⧫</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">♠</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\blacklozenge\spadesuit</annotation></semantics></math></sup>
Pegah Alipoormolabashi<sup id="id2" class="ltx_sup"><math id="m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\blacklozenge" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">⧫</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\blacklozenge</annotation></semantics></math></sup>
Jihu Mun<sup id="id3" class="ltx_sup"><math id="m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\blacklozenge" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">⧫</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\blacklozenge</annotation></semantics></math></sup>
